evdev, uploads an FF_HAPTIC effect, and then closes the HID device
(UHID_DESTROY) while still holding the evdev fd, closing it last. Build:
cc -O2 -static -o haptic_uaf haptic_uaf.c ; run on a KASAN kernel.

